# 🌟 Overview

**HoloJARVIS** is an advanced **AI-powered physical holographic assistant** that combines intelligent software with custom hardware to create a futuristic desktop AI companion.

Unlike traditional AI assistants that only exist as software, HoloJARVIS is a **real physical device** capable of interacting through voice, holographic visualization, computer automation, computer vision, and remote access.

The system is powered by a **Raspberry Pi 5**, custom-designed enclosure, holographic optical projection system, microphones, speakers, camera, and modern AI technologies.

HoloJARVIS acts as an intelligent assistant, AI programmer, automation system, remote workstation, and holographic interface—all in one compact desktop device.

---

# 🎯 Vision

The goal of HoloJARVIS is to build an AI assistant that feels alive.

Instead of opening ChatGPT in a browser, you simply walk to your desk and talk naturally to your AI assistant.

The assistant can:

- Understand natural language
- Display a holographic AI avatar
- Answer technical questions
- Write complete software projects
- Control connected computers
- Search the internet
- Automate repetitive tasks
- Monitor systems
- Remember conversations
- Execute commands remotely

HoloJARVIS bridges the gap between physical robotics and modern AI.

---

# 🖥 Hardware Architecture

The physical device is built around Raspberry Pi 5 and contains multiple integrated systems.

## Core Hardware

- Raspberry Pi 5 (8GB)
- 2.4" TFT LCD Display
- Raspberry Pi Camera
- SPH0645 MEMS I2S Microphone
- PAM8403 Stereo Amplifier
- Dual 3" 4Ω Speakers
- 100mm Convex Magnifying Lens
- 100mm Watch Glass
- 45° Reflective Glass
- Romoss 60000mAh Power Bank
- USB Power Switch
- Baseus 100W USB-C Cable
- LDNIO 100W GaN Charger

---

# 🔬 Holographic Projection System

The hologram is created using an optical reflection system.

```
45° Reflective Glass
          │
          ▼
100mm Watch Glass
          │
          ▼
100mm Convex Lens
          │
          ▼
2.4" TFT LCD Display
```

The LCD displays a transparent animated AI avatar.

The optical system enlarges and reflects the image, creating a floating holographic illusion.

